  "family": "global",
  "lineage": "Tiatr is Konkani-language popular musical theatre, first staged in Bombay at the end of the nineteenth century with Lucasinho Ribeiro's Italian Bhurgo and carried to Goa, where it remains a mass entertainment. Its kantaram are songs performed between the scenes, often comic or topical, satirical or political commentary independent of the plot, accompanied by a live band of keyboard, trumpet, saxophone, bass guitar and drums.",
